## Setup

Run the setup script to create symlinks:

```bash
./scripts/setup.sh
```

This links the skill to `~/.agents/skills/go-testing-tools`, `~/.claude/skills/go-testing-tools`, and `~/.codex/skills/go-testing-tools`.

To remove:

```bash
./scripts/deinit.sh
```
Download a board resource and save it locally.

If --output is omitted, the file is materialized under:
  .temp/resources/<ELEMENT-ID>/<NAME>

Nested resource names preserve their directory hierarchy below the element.

Use --output - to write the resource bytes to stdout.

Usage:
  task-board resource get <ELEMENT-ID> <NAME> [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help            help for get
  -o, --output string   Write resource to this path (default: .temp/resources/<ELEMENT-ID>/<NAME>, use - for stdout)

Global Flags:
      --board-dir string         Path to the board directory (overrides TASK_BOARD_DIR and config local.board_dir) (default ".task-board")
      --context-profile string   Agent context profile override: full or lite
      --insecure                 Skip TLS certificate verification (for self-signed certs)
      --json                     Output in JSON format
      --no-update-check          Disable automatic update check
      --remote string            Remote board server URL (overrides TASK_BOARD_REMOTE)
      --remote-board string      Remote board ID (overrides TASK_BOARD_ID)

